            <ArticleTitle>Otorhinolaryngologic causes of headache.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>677-92</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pain around the face and neck is common. This pain may be referred from a different area. Because patients usually present with pain and discomfort in a specific location such as the ear, nose, face, throat, or neck, this article discusses separately the innervation of each region and the most frequent causes of pain in each of these areas.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
